CodeMyRobot.ca is a charity sponsored initiative that does not sell robots    HOWEVER

Our robots are open source anyone can build them …  just order the parts.   Here is how

1. go to our info page, grab the part names and search aliexpress.com for the part,  they will ship them to you
2. go to https://a2delectronics.ca/product-category/robot  this student run store has what you need an more
